(2173, '7079848501', '📦 **Đơn hàng mới từ API** 📦\r\n\r\n🆔 **Mã giao dịch:** `729451`  \r\n👤 **Người dùng:** `tinhtrantrantinh2k4@gmail.com`  \r\n🌐 **Tên miền:** `smmvn.shop`  \r\n🛠️ **Dịch vụ:** `TikTok - Comments ~ Custom ~ 𝐇𝐐 Profiles ~ Min 1 ~ 100k/Day ~ Instant ~ 𝐍𝐎 𝗥𝗘𝗙𝗜𝗟𝗟`  \r\n🏢 **Nhà cung cấp:** `https://smmgen.com/api/v2`  \r\n🔗 **Liên kết:** `https://www.tiktok.com/@sksknw6/video/7595199298392935687`  \r\n💬 **Ghi chú:** `🌸 Heartopia feels so calm the moment I log in, really relaxing\nHeartopia chơi lúc rảnh đúng kiểu chữa lành luôn 😌\n✨ This game has such a cozy vibe, Heartopia is perfect for chill time\nChơi Heartopia mà quên luôn thời gian trôi nhanh ghê ⏳\n💖 Heartopia is like a small peaceful world away from stress\nGame này màu sắc nhìn dễ chịu thật sự 🌿\n🌙 Playing Heartopia at night hits different, super chill\nHeartopia đúng kiểu game nhẹ nhàng, không cần try hard\n🎶 The background music in Heartopia is so soothing\nVào Heartopia là thấy tâm trạng dịu xuống liền\n🍃 Heartopia gives me cozy and warm feelings every time\nChơi một lúc là thấy đầu óc nhẹ hẳn ra\n💫 Heartopia has that healing-game energy\nGame này hợp chơi sau một ngày dài mệt mỏi\n🌈 Heartopia looks cute but also feels very relaxing\nMấy chi tiết nhỏ trong game làm mình thích ghê\n🕊️ Heartopia is perfect when you just want to relax\nChơi mà không bị áp lực, đúng kiểu casual game\n🎮 Heartopia is simple but somehow addictive\nGame này chơi lâu mà không bị nặng đầu\n🌸 Heartopia makes everything feel slower and calmer\nChơi xong tự nhiên thấy mood tốt hơn hẳn\n✨ I love how peaceful Heartopia feels\nGame kiểu này đúng hợp để giải tỏa stress\n💖 Heartopia is my go-to game when I want to chill\nChơi trong phòng yên tĩnh chắc còn đã hơn nữa\n🌿 Heartopia’s art style is really soft and pleasing\nGame không cần cạnh tranh mà vẫn cuốn\n🌙 Heartopia feels like a warm place at night\nChơi nhẹ nhàng mà vẫn có cảm giác tiến triển\n🎶 The sound design in Heartopia is really calming\nVào game là thấy mọi thứ chậm lại liền\n🍃 Heartopia is perfect for cozy gaming sessions\nGame này mà mở lên trước khi ngủ chắc hợp lắm\n💫 Heartopia gives peaceful vibes all the way\nChơi mà không cần suy nghĩ nhiều, thích ghê\n🌸 Heartopia is cute, calm, and comforting`  \r\n🔢 **Số lượng:** `37`  \r\n💵 **Thanh toán:** `1.085đ`  \r\n🌍 **Địa chỉ IP:** `113.190.44.63`  \r\n⏰ **Thời gian:** `2026/01/16 00:01:52`  \r\n', '8488846472:AAHk_SFKn1IfcWK0IpDwt5AE0o-U8RtHG10', '{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"message_id\":2154,\"from\":{\"id\":8488846472,\"is_bot\":true,\"first_name\":\"SMMVN Notifications\",\"username\":\"smmvn_bot\"},\"chat\":{\"id\":7079848501,\"first_name\":\"b07vn\",\"username\":\"thanhbinhdev\",\"type\":\"private\"},\"date\":1768496514,\"text\":\"\\ud83d\\udce6 \\u0110\\u01a1n h\\u00e0ng m\\u1edbi t\\u1eeb API \\ud83d\\udce6\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udd94 M\\u00e3 giao d\\u1ecbch: 729451  \\n\\ud83d\\udc64 Ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng: tinhtrantrantinh2k4@gmail.com  \\n\\ud83c\\udf10 T\\u00ean mi\\u1ec1n: smmvn.shop  \\n\\ud83d\\udee0\\ufe0f D\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5: TikTok - Comments ~ Custom ~ \\ud835\\udc07\\ud835\\udc10 Profiles ~ Min 1 ~ 100k/Day ~ Instant ~ \\ud835\\udc0d\\ud835\\udc0e \\ud835\\udde5\\ud835\\uddd8\\ud835\\uddd9\\ud835\\udddc\\ud835\\udddf\\ud835\\udddf  \\n\\ud83c\\udfe2 Nh\\u00e0 cung c\\u1ea5p: https://smmgen.com/api/v2  \\n\\ud83d\\udd17 Li\\u00ean k\\u1ebft: https://www.tiktok.com/@sksknw6/video/7595199298392935687  \\n\\ud83d\\udcac Ghi ch\\u00fa: \\ud83c\\udf38 Heartopia feels so calm the moment I log in, really relaxing\\nHeartopia ch\\u01a1i l\\u00fac r\\u1ea3nh \\u0111\\u00fang ki\\u1ec3u ch\\u1eefa l\\u00e0nh lu\\u00f4n \\ud83d\\ude0c\\n\\u2728 This game has such a cozy vibe, Heartopia is perfect for chill time\\nCh\\u01a1i Heartopia m\\u00e0 qu\\u00ean lu\\u00f4n th\\u1eddi gian tr\\u00f4i nhanh gh\\u00ea \\u23f3\\n\\ud83d\\udc96 Heartopia is like a small peaceful world away from stress\\nGame n\\u00e0y m\\u00e0u s\\u1eafc nh\\u00ecn d\\u1ec5 ch\\u1ecbu th\\u1eadt s\\u1ef1 \\ud83c\\udf3f\\n\\ud83c\\udf19 Playing Heartopia at night hits different, super chill\\nHeartopia \\u0111\\u00fang ki\\u1ec3u game nh\\u1eb9 nh\\u00e0ng, kh\\u00f4ng c\\u1ea7n try hard\\n\\ud83c\\udfb6 The background music in Heartopia is so soothing\\nV\\u00e0o Heartopia l\\u00e0 th\\u1ea5y t\\u00e2m tr\\u1ea1ng d\\u1ecbu xu\\u1ed1ng li\\u1ec1n\\n\\ud83c\\udf43 Heartopia gives me cozy and warm feelings every time\\nCh\\u01a1i m\\u1ed9t l\\u00fac l\\u00e0 th\\u1ea5y \\u0111\\u1ea7u \\u00f3c nh\\u1eb9 h\\u1eb3n ra\\n\\ud83d\\udcab Heartopia has that healing-game energy\\nGame n\\u00e0y h\\u1ee3p ch\\u01a1i sau m\\u1ed9t ng\\u00e0y d\\u00e0i m\\u1ec7t m\\u1ecfi\\n\\ud83c\\udf08 Heartopia looks cute but also feels very relaxing\\nM\\u1ea5y chi ti\\u1ebft nh\\u1ecf trong game l\\u00e0m m\\u00ecnh th\\u00edch gh\\u00ea\\n\\ud83d\\udd4a\\ufe0f Heartopia is perfect when you just want to relax\\nCh\\u01a1i m\\u00e0 kh\\u00f4ng b\\u1ecb \\u00e1p l\\u1ef1c, \\u0111\\u00fang ki\\u1ec3u casual game\\n\\ud83c\\udfae Heartopia is simple but somehow addictive\\nGame n\\u00e0y ch\\u01a1i l\\u00e2u m\\u00e0 kh\\u00f4ng b\\u1ecb n\\u1eb7ng \\u0111\\u1ea7u\\n\\ud83c\\udf38 Heartopia makes everything feel slower and calmer\\nCh\\u01a1i xong t\\u1ef1 nhi\\u00ean th\\u1ea5y mood t\\u1ed1t h\\u01a1n h\\u1eb3n\\n\\u2728 I love how peaceful Heartopia feels\\nGame ki\\u1ec3u n\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u00fang h\\u1ee3p \\u0111\\u1ec3 gi\\u1ea3i t\\u1ecfa stress\\n\\ud83d\\udc96 Heartopia is my go-to game when I want to chill\\nCh\\u01a1i trong ph\\u00f2ng y\\u00ean t\\u0129nh ch\\u1eafc c\\u00f2n \\u0111\\u00e3 h\\u01a1n n\\u1eefa\\n\\ud83c\\udf3f Heartopia\\u2019s art style is really soft and pleasing\\nGame kh\\u00f4ng c\\u1ea7n c\\u1ea1nh tranh m\\u00e0 v\\u1eabn cu\\u1ed1n\\n\\ud83c\\udf19 Heartopia feels like a warm place at night\\nCh\\u01a1i nh\\u1eb9 nh\\u00e0ng m\\u00e0 v\\u1eabn c\\u00f3 c\\u1ea3m gi\\u00e1c ti\\u1ebfn tri\\u1ec3n\\n\\ud83c\\udfb6 The sound design in Heartopia is really calming\\nV\\u00e0o game l\\u00e0 th\\u1ea5y m\\u1ecdi th\\u1ee9 ch\\u1eadm l\\u1ea1i li\\u1ec1n\\n\\ud83c\\udf43 Heartopia is perfect for cozy gaming sessions\\nGame n\\u00e0y m\\u00e0 m\\u1edf l\\u00ean tr\\u01b0\\u1edbc khi ng\\u1ee7 ch\\u1eafc h\\u1ee3p l\\u1eafm\\n\\ud83d\\udcab Heartopia gives peaceful vibes all the way\\nCh\\u01a1i m\\u00e0 kh\\u00f4ng c\\u1ea7n suy ngh\\u0129 nhi\\u1ec1u, th\\u00edch gh\\u00ea\\n\\ud83c\\udf38 Heartopia is cute, calm, and comforting  \\n\\ud83d\\udd22 S\\u1ed1 l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng: 37  \\n\\ud83d\\udcb5 Thanh to\\u00e1n: 1.085\\u0111  \\n\\ud83c\\udf0d \\u0110\\u1ecba ch\\u1ec9 IP: 113.190.44.63  \\n\\u23f0 Th\\u1eddi gian: 2026/01/16 00:01:52\",\"entities\":[{\"offset\":44,\"length\":6,\"type\":\"code\"},{\"offset\":68,\"length\":29,\"type\":\"code\"},{\"offset\":113,\"length\":10,\"type\":\"code\"},{\"offset\":139,\"length\":91,\"type\":\"code\"},{\"offset\":250,\"length\":25,\"type\":\"code\"},{\"offset\":291,\"length\":57,\"type\":\"code\"},{\"offset\":363,\"length\":1789,\"type\":\"code\"},{\"offset\":2168,\"length\":2,\"type\":\"code\"},{\"offset\":2188,\"length\":6,\"type\":\"code\"},{\"offset\":2212,\"length\":13,\"type\":\"code\"},{\"offset\":2241,\"length\":19,\"type\":\"code\"}]}}', '2026-01-16 00:01:53'),
