(3259, '7079848501', '📦 **Đơn hàng mới từ API** 📦\r\n\r\n🆔 **Mã giao dịch:** `481529`  \r\n👤 **Người dùng:** `tinhtrantrantinh2k4@gmail.com`  \r\n🌐 **Tên miền:** `smmvn.shop`  \r\n🛠️ **Dịch vụ:** `Instagram - Comments - Custom ~ Indian  🇮🇳 1k-5k/Days ~ INSTANT`  \r\n🏢 **Nhà cung cấp:** `https://smmgen.com/api/v2`  \r\n🔗 **Liên kết:** `https://www.instagram.com/p/DVqvwXDid-4/`  \r\n💬 **Ghi chú:** `Watching them dash 100 times while I just press one button 😂⚡\nBhai wo Ling wall pe ud raha hai aur main yahan wait kar raha hoon 🕒🔪\n他の手速はすごいけど、私のワンパンはもっと確実だね ✨🗡️\n100 combos vs 1 click, the logic is simple and effective 🧠💥\nGila sih Hayabusa-nya lincah bgt, tapi tetep mati di udara ☁️💀\nNapaka-flashy ng Gusion pero isang ulti lang ang katapat nyan 🎯🔥\n别人在秀操作，而我在旁边默默按大招 🤫📉\n피지컬 싸움 할 때 나는 그냥 딸깍 한 번이면 끝남 🖱️👑\nImagine practicing for hours just to get countered by one tap 🤡🚫\nBeda kelas bgt, yang một pusing yang một santai aja bro 🤙🌊\nEveryone is practicing fast hands but I choose the easiest way\nWo Gusion ke blades ginte reh gaye aur main kill le gaya\n爆速コンボもいいけど、確実な一撃のほうが強い気がする\n华丽的走位在绝对的压制面前根本没有意义\n다른 사람들 손가락 바쁠 때 나는 그냥 여유롭게 구경함\nDaripada ribet mending sekali klik musuh langsung balik lobby\nGalawang lodi pero laging huli sa dulo ng talim ko\nThe enemy team is playing 4D chess while I am playing checkers\nMehnat unki hai par result mera hai sachi mein\nGusion players are always so busy but the result is the same`  \r\n🔢 **Số lượng:** `20`  \r\n💵 **Thanh toán:** `474đ`  \r\n🌍 **Địa chỉ IP:** `14.191.162.157`  \r\n⏰ **Thời gian:** `2026/03/09 22:58:19`  \r\n', '8488846472:AAHk_SFKn1IfcWK0IpDwt5AE0o-U8RtHG10', '{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"message_id\":3325,\"from\":{\"id\":8488846472,\"is_bot\":true,\"first_name\":\"SMMVN Notifications\",\"username\":\"smmvn_bot\"},\"chat\":{\"id\":7079848501,\"first_name\":\"Darkline7\",\"username\":\"thanhbinhdev\",\"type\":\"private\"},\"date\":1773071902,\"text\":\"\\ud83d\\udce6 \\u0110\\u01a1n h\\u00e0ng m\\u1edbi t\\u1eeb API \\ud83d\\u