e power.\nBhai, is video ne toh system hila diya.\n最後の一撃が完璧なタイミングで入ったね。\n被动叠满的那一刻，对面坦克就像纸一样 🧱❌\nLakas maka-carry sa rank game, nakakabilib.\nGak bosen-bosen liat gameplay lodi satu ini.\nLate game scaling is just completely out of control 📈🔥\nBhai, gold management seekh lo varna ye hero bekar hai.\n彼女の矢が戦場を支配しているのがわかります。\n这就是所谓的老牌射手的压制力。\nAng husay mo mag-positioning sa clash 🛡️✨\nFix sih, hero ini emang gak ada obat kalo dah full item.\nStill the most dangerous marksman in the right hands.\nBhai, is montage mein kya hi editing ki hai tune.\n不滅の戦場で生き残るための必須スキルだね。\n这个大招用的，解控杀人一气呵成。\nImmortal rank is just another playground for her 🎡👑\nSobrang petmalu nung savage sa dulo, headshot!\nLifesteal so high you don\\\'t even need a healer.\nBhai, marksman users ke liye ye video inspiration hai.\n影から現れて一瞬で仕留めるスタイルが大好き 🌑💀\n只要你不禁用她，你就要做好输掉的准备。\nAng lupet nung double kill under tower.\nBener-bener gak dikasih nafas lawan di gold lane.\nA nightmare in the bush, wait for the red eyes 👁️💀\nBhai, iska attack speed dekh ke hosh udd gaye.\n彼女のビルdが完璧すぎて参考になります。\n这种攻速流打法才是上分的最快路径。\nNapakaganda nung edit mo bro, bagay sa music 🎶🔥\nMain di immortal emang butuh mekanik kayak gini.\nTotal annihilation once the first item drops.\nBhai, dushman core ko toh darr ke rehna padega.\n究極技でピンチを脱出する瞬間、鳥肌立った。\n哪怕是针对她，只要拖到后期就赢了。\nLodi talaga, soul extractor level yung damage ⚰️✨\nMusuh auto ketar-ketir liat build itemnya.\nThe ultimate comeback is always led by a pro bow user.\nBhai, ye matchup toh legend ban jayega sachi mein.\n彼女の放つ一撃一撃が致命傷だね 🏹🎯\n这一场简直是单方面的屠杀，太惨了。\nNapakalakas ng presence mo sa map lodi.\nGila lifesteal-nya beneran gak masuk akal 🩸🧱\nWatching her melt the lord in seconds is satisfying.\nBhai, is player ka aura hi alag hai MLBB mein.\nステルス解除からのバーストダメージが凄まじい。\n只要队友能抗住，她就能输出全世界。\nRewrite the stars and get that win champion 🌟🏆\nBeneran kasta tertinggi marksman di rank tinggi.\nHer survivability is surprisingly high in this patch.\nBhai, is edit ka transitions bohot hard hai.\n彼女はまさに戦場の女神として君臨している。\n在这种局拿五杀，操作意识缺一不可。\nAng galing nung pagkaka-execute nung burst combo 💥⚡\nAsli ngeri bgt damage-nya pas item-nya udah jadi.\nImmortal logic: Don\\\'t let her farm or it\\\'s over.\nBhai, iska movement dushman ko pareshan karta hai.\n完璧なポジショニング、プロの試合を見ているよう。\n这就是为什么大家在高端局还是怕她的原因。\nNapakasakit tignan nung HP bar ng kalaban 📉😱\nFix kasta tertinggi laning phase di season này lah.\nA true god in the immortal rank, no debate here.\nBhai, kya insanely pro gameplay dikhaya tune boss.\n彼女の放つ矢の雨から逃れることはできない 🌊🌪️\n这爆发伤害，对面坦克估计都怀疑人生了。\nSobrang lodi, bawat galaw may kasamang kill order.\nMainnya rapi bgt, musuh sampe pusing nyarinya.\nThat flicker outplay during the invisibility was genius.\nBhai, is match ka hero toh ye bow master hi hai.\n彼女の連殺シーン、何度見ても飽きないわ 🔁🔥\n这一波五连绝世真的是实至名归。\nNapakahusay nung pagkaka-edit, ramdam yung tension.\nPaling mantap emang kalo lifesteal-nya deres bgt.\nThe distance she keeps while kiting is perfection.\nBhai, ye trick sikhna padega rank push ke liye.\n隠密行動からの急襲、これぞ最強の戦術 🥷✨\n只要装备成型，她就是移动的机关枪。\nWalang kawala yung enemy core sa bilis niya.\nUdah tanky tapi tetep aja tembus damagenya, ngeri.\nEverything aligned for this legendary clip today.\nBhai, kya timing pe effects dale hain tune ✨🕺\n彼女の機動力、もはや次元が違います。\n祝融之后我就没见过这么猛的射手。\nLakas maka-anime nung editing mo lodi 🎬🔥\nGak nyangka dapet savage se-clean này di rank.\nThe lifesteal regen is basically a hack at this point.\nBhai, is video ki quality toh 10/10 hai 💎🎬\n不滅のランク帯で無双するのは夢があるね。\n这种输出频率，对面连大招都放不出来。\nNapakahusay, outclassed yung kabilang marksman.\nBener-bener jadi penguasa di lane gold lodi.\nOne arrow is enough to send them to the fountain.\nBhai, iska gussa dushman par bhari pad gaya.\n彼女の剣（弓）に死角なし、圧倒的だ。\n这个剪辑节奏配合大招，帅炸了 🎬💥\nAng ganda ng graphics ng skin na to lodi.\nMain MGCC bosen, mending liat gameplay immortal ini.\nThe heartbeat of the team is in her quiver.\nBhai, tune toh hero ko god level bana diya 🛐🔥\n彼女の攻撃は雷のように速くて正確ですね。\n这一记连招接普攻，对面直接消失。\nSobrang galing ng diskarte mo sa teamfight!\nBener-bener lincah, musuh cuma bisa pasrah 🏃‍♂️🚫\nLate game potential is just limitless for her.\nBhai Sora ka edit dekha tha par ye bhi aag hai.\n彼女の存在感、チーム全体の士気を上げるね。\n这种级别的收割，全靠个人的反应能力。\nNapakasolid ng logic mo sa game lodi sora fan 🧠⚡\nFix sih, hero ini emang king of late game 👑🔥\nHer lifesteal is the only thing keeping us in.\nBhai, marksman users ke liye ye tutorial hai.\n彼女の動き、まるで残像を見ているようだ 💨✨\n在顶级对决中，这个大招的时机就是神。\nAng lupet nung transition nung skin lodi.\nMainnya quá khét đối thủ chỉ biết khóc thét.\nImmortal rank Miya is just a different breed 🦁⚡\nBhai, iska passive trigger hote hi sab khatam.\n彼女の舞、戦場を支配している女神のようだ。\n这种英雄的操作上限真的是无穷无尽的。\nNapakasakit sa ulo nung attack speed effects 😵‍💫✨\nBener-bener jadi monster yang ditakuti musuh.\nThe wind is her ally and death is her weapon.\nBhai, ye video loop pe dekh raha hoon sachi.\n彼女のスキルセット、シンプルだけど奥が深い。\n这就是传说中的走 A 怪吧，太丝滑了。\nSobrang petmalu nung critical damage sa dulo.\nWalang kupas yung skills kahit ilang patch na.\nAbsolute dominance in the gold lane tonight 🏹🥇\nBhai, dushman ko base mein hi lock kar diya.\n彼女の不屈の戦いぶりに本当に感動した。\n在这种压力下还能稳稳输出，心态真好。\nAng ganda nung choice nung music lodi 🎶✨\nGila sih combo-nya bener-bener mematikan.\nThe stars were rewritten for our childhood hero.\nBhai, is skin mein Miya bohot cool lag rahi hai.\n不滅の輝き、それが彼女の本当の力だね 🌟🏹\n这一战之后你就是国服第一射手了。\nNapaka-bilis ng kamay mo lodi sa pag-rotate.\nBintang 3 di chess lewat, ini Miya immortal!\nWinning is easy when you take their soul first.\nBhai, is video ne mera din bana diya 😲✨\n彼女の影に捕まったら最後、逃げ場はない。\n这一招回马枪真的绝了，学到了学到了。\nSobrang lodi talaga no debate needed here 🚫🗣️\nBener-bener penguasa Land of Dawn sejati.\nMiya is still the queen of marksmen 🏹👑\nBhai, iska damage output unbelievable hai.\n彼女の機動力には誰も追いつけないよ。\n这种爆发流射手简直是后排的梦魇。\nNapakaganda ng quality ng video mo lodi! ✨🎥\nEnjoy the silence before she appears and kills.  \r\n\r\nCảm ơn bạn đã tin tưởng sử dụng dịch vụ của chúng tôi! Nếu bạn có bất kỳ câu hỏi nào, đừng ngần ngại liên hệ với chúng tôi.\r\n\r\nChúc bạn một ngày tuyệt vời! 😊', '8488846472:AAHk_SFKn1IfcWK0IpDwt5AE0o-U8RtHG10', '{\"ok\":false,\"error_code\":400,\"description\":\"Bad Request: message is too long\"}', '2026-03-13 15:38:45');
INSERT INTO `bot_telegram_logs` (`id`, `chat_id`, `message`, `token`, `response`, `created_at`) VALUES
(3302, '7079848501', '📦 **Đơn hàng mới từ API** 📦\r\n\r\n🆔 **Mã giao dịch:** `643219`  \r\n👤 **Người dùng:** `tinhtrantrantinh2k4@gmail.com`  \r\n🌐 **Tên miền:** `smmvn.shop`  \r\n🛠️ **Dịch vụ:** `Instagram Comments ~ Custom ~ Super Quality ~ Max 10k ~ 1k-5k/Day ~ 0-2 hrs`  \r\n🏢 **Nhà cung cấp:** `https://smmgen.com/api/v2`  \r\n🔗 **Liên kết:** `https://www.instagram.com/p/DVtY-Igk4FV/`  \r\n💬 **Ghi chú:** `That winter truncheon switch was too fast for my eyes! ❄️✨\nBhai ye item switch karne ka speed toh illegal hai! 😱🔥\n这个秒换装备的手速，简直是职业级别的 ⌨️⚡\n아이템 스왑 속도가 거의 신의 경지네요 🛐💎\nGila sih, item swap-nya beneran murni fast hand 🤙🔥\nNapakalupet ng fast hand moves mo lodi, grabe! 🚀✨\n指の動きが人間業じゃない気がする 😂🎮\nSwitching from immortality to winter in half a second is crazy! ⌛💥\n兰斯洛特在这一刻完成了华丽的逆转 👑⚔️\nIsang kurap mo lang, naka-winter truncheon na siya! 👁️🌪️\nI can\\\'t even buy one item and he already swapped three.\nEquipping Rose Gold Meteor in the middle of the dive was legendary.\nBhai iska gameplay dekh kar mera dimaag ghum gaya.\n装备的切り替えが早すぎて何が起きたか分からなかった。\n불멸 깨지자마자 겨울의 지팡이로 바꾸는 거 소름.\n换装不需要看商店吗？反应也太快了。\nDefinisi jari mekanik yang sesungguhnya ada di sini.\nPaano mag-switch ng item ng ganun kabilis sa phone?\nThe mechanical skill required for this is just insane.\nImmortality se winter truncheon ek second mein swap kiya.\n不死鳥から冬の杖への持ち替え、完璧なタイミング。\n이런 피지컬은 도대체 어떻게 키우는 거죠?\n这种手速不去打职业真的太可惜了。\nMusuh pasti kesel liat immortal ganti rose gold secepat itu.\nSolid yung gameplay, hindi lang laning pati shop speed.\nMy fingers hurt just watching this item swap speed.\nItni speed se toh main potion bhi nahi khareed sakta.\nこの持ち替え技術、ランクで真似したい。\n아이템 창 열고 닫는 속도가 미쳤어요.\n复活甲秒换名刀，这操作看呆我了。\nTutor dong bang cara setting shop biar cepet ganti item.\nWalang kupas yung bilis ng kamay, pang M-series na yan.\nHow is his ping so low to do that swap perfectly?\nKya fast hands hain yaar, dushman ko moka hi nahi diya.\n反応速度100点満点の神プレイだね。\n손이 눈보다 빠르자는 게 이런 거구나 싶다.\n兰斯洛特的操作上限真的被你玩出来了。\nIni sih bukan sekedar main, tapi seni ganti item.\nPetmalu yung lifesteal sabay palit ng item sa dulo.\nPro players make item switching look like magic.\nAsli, skill mekanik abang ini ngeri banget pas war.\n装备切换的节奏点踩得非常准。\n영상 보는데 박수가 절로 나오는 컨트롤입니다.\nランスロット使いならこの速さを目指すべき。\nBhai tutorial dalo fast hand switching ka please.\nImagine being the enemy and seeing him survive with 1 HP.\nThat fast hand skill is what separates pro from epic.\n全场最亮眼的换装瞬间，手速爆表。\n아이템 구매의 속도가 이 세상 레벨이 아니야.\nNgayon lang ako nakakita ng ganitong kabilis mag-build.\nThat winter truncheon switch was too fast for my eyes! ❄️✨\nBhai ye item switch karne ka speed toh illegal hai! 😱🔥\n这个秒换装备的手速，简直是职业级别的 ⌨️⚡\n아이템 스왑 속도가 거의 신의 경지네요 🛐💎\nGila sih, item swap-nya beneran murni fast hand 🤙🔥\nNapakalupet ng fast hand moves mo lodi, grabe! 🚀✨\n指の動きが人間業じゃない気がする 😂🎮\nSwitching from immortality to winter in half a second is crazy! ⌛💥\n兰斯洛特在这一刻完成了华丽的逆转 👑⚔️\nIsang kurap mo lang, naka-winter truncheon na siya! 👁️🌪️\nI can\\\'t even buy one item and he already swapped three.\nEquipping Rose Gold Meteor in the middle of the dive was legendary.\nBhai iska gameplay dekh kar mera dimaag ghum gaya.\n装备的切り替えが早すぎて何が起きたか分からなかった。\n불멸 깨지자마자 겨울의 지팡이로 바꾸는 거 소름.\n换装不需要看商店吗？反应也太快了。\nDefinisi jari mekanik yang sesungguhnya ada di sini.\nPaano mag-switch ng item ng ganun kabilis sa phone?\nThe mechanical skill required for this is just insane.\nImmortality se winter truncheon ek second mein swap kiya.\n不死鳥から冬の杖への持ち替え、完璧なタイミング。\n이런 피지컬은 도대체 어떻게 키우는 거죠?\n这种手速不去打职业真的太可惜了。\nMusuh pasti kesel liat immortal ganti rose gold secepat itu.\nSolid yung gameplay, hindi lang laning pati shop speed.\nMy fingers hurt just watching this item swap speed.\nItni speed se toh main potion bhi nahi khareed sakta.\nこの持ち替え技術、ランクで真似したい。\n아이템 창 열고 닫는 속도가 미쳤어요.\n复活甲秒换名刀，这操作看呆我了。\nTutor dong bang cara setting shop biar cepet ganti item.\nWalang kupas yung bilis ng kamay, pang M-series na yan.\nHow is his ping so low to do that swap perfectly?\nKya fast hands hain yaar, dushman ko moka h