(3306, '7079848501', '📦 **Đơn hàng mới từ API** 📦\r\n\r\n🆔 **Mã giao dịch:** `924718`  \r\n👤 **Người dùng:** `tinhtrantrantinh2k4@gmail.com`  \r\n🌐 **Tên miền:** `smmvn.shop`  \r\n🛠️ **Dịch vụ:** `Instagram Comments ~ Custom ~ Super Quality ~ Max 10k ~ 1k-5k/Day ~ 0-2 hrs`  \r\n🏢 **Nhà cung cấp:** `https://smmgen.com/api/v2`  \r\n🔗 **Liên kết:** `https://www.instagram.com/reel/DVdgx5jE0U5/`  \r\n💬 **Ghi chú:** `That winter truncheon switch was too fast for my eyes! ❄️✨\nBhai ye item switch karne ka speed toh illegal hai! 😱🔥\n这个秒换装备的手速，简直是职业级别的 ⌨️⚡\n아이템 스왑 속도가 거의 신의 경지네요 🛐💎\nGila sih, item swap-nya beneran murni fast hand 🤙🔥\nNapakalupet ng fast hand moves mo lodi, grabe! 🚀✨\n指の動きが人間業じゃない気がする 😂🎮\nSwitching from immortality to winter in half a second is crazy! ⌛💥\n兰斯洛特在这一刻完成了华丽的逆转 👑⚔️\nIsang kurap mo lang, naka-winter truncheon na siya! 👁️🌪️\nI can\\\'t even buy one item and he already swapped three.\nEquipping Rose Gold Meteor in the middle of the dive was legendary.\nBhai iska gameplay dekh kar mera dimaag ghum gaya.\n装备的切り替えが早すぎて何が起きたか分からなかった。\n불멸 깨지자마자 겨울의 지팡이로 바꾸는 거 소름.\n换装不需要看商店吗？反应也太快了。\nDefinisi jari mekanik yang sesungguhnya ada di sini.\nPaano mag-switch ng item ng ganun kabilis sa phone?\nThe mechanical skill required for this is just insane.\nImmortality se winter truncheon ek second mein swap kiya.\n不死鳥から冬の杖への持ち替え、完璧なタイミング。\n이런 피지컬은 도대체 어떻게 키우는 거죠?\n这种手速不去打职业真的太可惜了。\nMusuh pasti kesel liat immortal ganti rose gold secepat itu.\nSolid yung gameplay, hindi lang laning pati shop speed.\nMy fingers hurt just watching this item swap speed.\nItni speed se toh main potion bhi nahi khareed sakta.\nこの持ち替え技術、ランクで真似したい。\n아이템 창 열고 닫는 속도가 미쳤어요.\n复活甲秒换名刀，这操作看呆我了。\nTutor dong bang cara setting shop biar cepet ganti item.\nWalang kupas yung bilis ng kamay, pang M-series na yan.\nHow is his ping so low to do that swap perfectly?\nKya fast hands hain yaar, dushman ko moka hi nahi diya.\n反応速度100点満点の神プレイだね。\n손이 눈보다 빠르자는 게 이런 거구나 싶다.\n兰斯洛特的操作上限真的被你玩出来了。\nIni sih bukan sekedar main, tapi seni ganti item.\nPetmalu yung lifesteal sabay palit ng item sa dulo.\nPro players make item switching look like magic.\nAsli, skill mekanik abang ini ngeri banget pas war.\n装备切换的节奏点踩得非常准。\n영상 보는데 박수가 절로 나오는 컨트롤입니다.\nランスロット使いならこの速さを目指すべき。\nBhai tutorial dalo fast hand switching ka please.\nImagine being the enemy and seeing him survive with 1 HP.\nThat fast hand skill is what separates pro from epic.\n全场最亮眼的换装瞬间，手速爆表。\n아이템 구매의 속도가 이 세상 레벨이 아니야.\nNgayon lang ako nakakita ng ganitong kabilis mag-build.\nThat winter truncheon switch was too fast for my eyes! ❄️✨\nBhai ye item switch karne ka speed toh illegal hai! 😱🔥\n这个秒换装备的手速，简直是职业级别的 ⌨️⚡\n아이템 스왑 속도가 거의 신의 경지네요 🛐💎\nGila sih, item swap-nya beneran murni fast hand 🤙🔥\nNapakalupet ng fast hand moves mo lodi, grabe! 🚀✨\n指の動きが人間業じゃない気がする 😂🎮\nSwitching from immortality to winter in half a second is crazy! ⌛💥\n兰斯洛特在这一刻完成了华丽的逆转 👑⚔️\nIsang kurap mo lang, naka-winter truncheon na siya! 👁️🌪️\nI can\\\'t even buy one item and he already swapped three.\nEquipping Rose Gold Meteor in the middle of the dive was legendary.\nBhai iska gameplay dekh kar mera dimaag ghum gaya.\n装备的切り替えが早すぎて何が起きたか分からなかった。\n불멸 깨지자마자 겨울의 지팡이로 바꾸는 거 소름.\n换装不需要看商店吗？反应也太快了。\nDefinisi jari mekanik yang sesungguhnya ada di sini.\nPaano mag-switch ng item ng ganun kabilis sa phone?\nThe mechanical skill required for this is just insane.\nImmortality se winter truncheon ek second mein swap kiya.\n不死鳥から冬の杖への持ち替え、完璧なタイミング。\n이런 피지컬은 도대체 어떻게 키우는 거죠?\n这种手速不去打职业真的太可惜了。\nMusuh pasti kesel liat immortal ganti rose gold secepat itu.\nSolid yung gameplay, hindi lang laning pati shop speed.\nMy fingers hurt just watching this item swap speed.\nItni speed se toh main potion bhi nahi khareed sakta.\nこの持ち替え技術、ランクで真似したい。\n아이템 창 열고 닫는 속도가 미쳤어요.\n复活甲秒换名刀，这操作看呆我了。\nTutor dong bang cara setting shop biar cepet ganti item.\nWalang kupas yung bilis ng kamay, pang M-series na yan.\nHow is his ping so low to do that swap perfectly?\nKya fast hands hain yaar, dushman ko mok