(3462, '6240586881', '🌟 **Thông báo giao dịch thành công!** 🌟\r\n\r\nChào bạn **tinhtrantrantinh2k4@gmail.com**,\r\n\r\nChúng tôi rất vui mừng thông báo rằng bạn đã mua dịch vụ thành công:\r\n\r\n🛠 **Dịch vụ:** Instagram Comments ~ Custom ~ Super Quality ~ Max 10k ~ 1k-5k/Day ~ 0-2 hrs  \r\n🌐 **Tên miền:** smmvn.shop  \r\n🧾 **Mã giao dịch:** 649371  \r\n💳 **Số tiền thanh toán:** 3.880đ  \r\n📦 **Số lượng:** 187  \r\n🕒 **Thời gian giao dịch:** 2026/03/13 16:49:47  \r\n🌍 **Địa chỉ IP:** 14.191.162.157  \r\n\r\n🔗 **Chi tiết dịch vụ:** [Xem tại đây](https://www.instagram.com/p/DUksZKYEn05/)  \r\n📝 **Ghi chú:** Those constant dashes are making me dizzy! 🌀✨\nZaman Force turned him into a monster 🔥👾\nBhai, iska dash speed toh light se bhi tez hai ⚡💨\n究極技の中での動きが速すぎて追いつけない 🌪️🚫\n大招里的每一个位移都是致命的 🗡️🔥\nZaman Force meta is back and it\\\'s looking scary 🌑💥\nAng lupet nung outplay sa laning phase lodi 🤙✨\nGila sih, lincah bgt kayak pake cheat jari mekanik ⌨️🔥\nHarith moves like a shadow in that magic circle 🌑✨\n1v3 under turret and still survived? Amazing! 🏰🛡️\nZaman Force ke andar koi bhi safe nahi hai 🚫💀\nこの編集のタイミングが完璧で最高です 🎬🔥\n这一波四杀拿得实至名归，操作太稳了 🏆🥇\nHarith beneran kasta tertinggi mage fighter lah 👑💎\nNapakasakit nung burst damage pag nabuo na items\nLook at the shield stack from all those dashes 🛡️✨\nBhai, next video mein Lancelot vs Harith dalo ⚔️🔥\n時空の歪みから逃げ出すのは不可能だね 🚫⌛\n这种节奏感剪辑看多少遍都不会腻 🤤🎬\nHarith plays in high rank are just different\nGak bosen-bosen liat gameplay mage lincah ini 🌀💖\nZaman Force makes him a god on the battlefield\nBhai, kya timing pe ultimate use kiya tune 🎯🔥\n連続ステップの正確さがすごすぎます\n这一记连招直接把对面的心态打崩了 📉💀\nSobrang lodi mo mag-edit, smooth bgt transitions 🎬✨\nHarith is too tanky with that constant shield 🧱✨\nZaman Force logic: I dash, you die\nBhai, is edit ka flow ekdum makkhan jaisa hai 🧈✨\n相手のスキルをすべて避けていく姿が芸術的\n祝融之后，我还是觉得这个小猫男更秀 🐱🔥\nNapakabilis ng kamay mo bro, parang naka-macros\nMain Harith emang paling asik pas dapet Maniac 🏆⚡\nInfinite jumps and infinite magic damage\nBhai, dushman team toh rone lagi hogi chat mein 😂😭\n彼の影に捕まったら最後、逃げ場はないよ\n在大招里跳舞的感觉真的太解压了 🤤✨\nSobrang solid nung build mo lodi, pashare naman 🛡️💎\nZaman Force duration feels like forever today ⏳🔥\nHarith is the real nightmare for slow fighters\nBhai iska cooldown zero hai kya? Crazy! 😱🌀\nカオス大乱闘ならもっとエグいことになりそう\n这种全屏位移，对面怎么预判你的位置 👁️❌\nAng galing nung timing ng bawat skill usage\nLincah parah, musuh cuma bisa bengong liatin 👁️👄👁️\nThe lifesteal is real when Zaman Force is up\nBhai, ye gameplay toh pro league level ka hai 🥇⚔️\n編集が綺麗で Harith がさらにかっこよく見える\n这个视频的特效被你剪辑得像电影大片 🎬🎞️\nHarith users be like: Press ult and spam dash\nGak ada obat, beneran beda level bro mantap 👍🔥\nZaman Force provides the perfect stage for kills\nBhai, kya insanely op precision dikhayi tune 🎯✨\n究極技が消える前に敵が全滅してるの草 🌱🚫\n每一帧都是画报，博主简直是剪辑大神 🎬🔥\nNapakahusay, outclassed yung kabilang midlaner 📈✨\nHarith remains a god in the right hands\nBhai, is video ki quality toh 10/10 hai 💎🎬\n彼女の舞、戦場を支配している女神のようだ 🌸✨\n这套连招配合这个BGM简直绝配了 🎵🔥\nLakas maka-vibe nung music choices mo bro 🎶✨\nMainnya rapi bgt, musuh sampe pusing nyarinya\nZero cooldown dashes are just too satisfying 🤤⚡\nBhai, tune toh hero ko god level bana diya 🛐🔥\nスピードも火力も、すべてにおいて上回ってる\n这一记重击直接把对面的尊严打没了 🔨❌\nNapakasolid ng logic mo sa game lodi sora fan 🧠⚡\nZaman Force activation is the end of the match\nBhai, is match ka hero toh Harith hi hai 🏆👑\n相手を絶望に突き落とすコンボ最高！ ✨🌪️\n面对这种压制，哪怕叫打野来也没用 📉🚫\nSobrang lupet ng edit mo lodi talaga boss! 🎬💎\nHarith is a literal beast in every teamfight 👹💥\nThis edit gives me chills, keep it up!\nBhai next level editing skills, keep it up 💯🎬\n魂まで削り取られるような立ち回りだね 👻✨\n对面的走位在这一波面前全是破绽 🎯✨\nGak bosen-bosen liat lifesteal-nya kenceng bgt\nHarith dash speed is just mind blowing bro 🧠⚡\nBhai iska har hit ek dhamaka hai 💥🔥\nこの曲を聴くと、なぜか勝利を確信するね 🎧✨\n这种操作手感，完全碾压了那个浮空怪\nRewrite the stars and get that win champion 🌟🏆\n編集のリズムとBGMが合ってて見てて楽しい ✨🎞️\n这个大招用的，解控杀人一气耗成 🗡️✨\nNakakabilib yung bawat move, grabe lodi 🙌🔥\nGak nyangka dapet savage se-clean này di rank 🏆✨\nThis slow motion breakdown shows how fast your fingers are\nBhai is level ki timing sirf pro players hi kar sakte hain\nこのボクサーの動きには一切の無駄がないですね\n对面的走位在这一波面前全是破绽\nNapakahusay nung fighter na to outclassed yung kalaban\nMainnya rapi banget musuh sampe pusing nyarinya\nThat punch logic is beyond my understanding\nBhai gold management seekh lo varna ye combo nahi banega\n完璧なポジショニング、プロの試合を見ているよう\n这种爆发力对面连大招都放不出来\nLodi talaga walang kupas yung skills sa fighter lane\nBeneran kasta tertinggi laning phase di season ini\nThe distance you keep while kiting is perfection\nBhai ye trick sikhna padega rank push ke liye\n隠密行動からの急襲これぞ最強の戦術\n这一场简直是单方面的屠杀太惨了\nNapakalakas ng presence mo sa map lodi\nGila damage-nya beneran gak masuk akal sih\nWatching him melt the enemy core in seconds is satisfying\nBhai is player ka aura hi alag hai MLBB mein\nステルス解除からのバーストダメージが凄まじい\n只要你会连招这局游戏你就赢了一半\nAng lupet nung double kill under tower kanina\nBener-bener gak dikasih nafas lawan di lane exp\nThe timing of the song is just flawless with the hits\nBhai kya insanely pro movement dikhaya tune boss\n彼の不屈の戦いぶりに本当に感動した\n这一战之后你就是国服第一操作手了\nNapaka-bilis ng kamay mo lodi sa pag-rotate\nBintang 3 di chess lewat gameplay này hơn hẳn\nWinning is easy when you take their soul first\nBhai is video ne mera din bana diya sachi mein\n彼の影に捕まったら最後逃げ場はない\n这一招回马枪真的绝了学到了学到了\nSobrang lodi talaga no debate needed here\nBener-bener penguasa Land of Dawn sejati\nStill the most dangerous fighter in the right hands\nBhai iska movement dushman ko pareshan karta hai\nこの編集スタイル海外のクリエイターみたい\n对面肯定在想为什么这么快就屏幕全黑了\nNapakasolid ng logic mo sa game lodi pro player\nFix sih hero ini emang king of late game\nLifesteal is the only thing keeping him alive there\nBhai marksman users ke liye ye tutorial hai\n彼の動きまるで残像を見ているようだ\n在顶级对决中这个大招的时机就是神\nAng lupet nung transition nung skin lodi\nMainnya quá khét đối thủ chỉ biết khóc thét\nThat outplay under the turret was purely mechanical\nBhai iska lifesteal toh tank ko bhi sharma de\n一瞬で敵を溶かす姿まさに神の領域\n哪怕是高星局后期依然是他的天下\nスローモーションでの連撃、まさに芸術ですね\n这种节奏感剪辑真的太解压了，赞一个 🤤🎬\nLakas maka-anime nung galaw mo bro, galing! 🎬🔥\nGak bosen-bosen liat lifesteal-nya kenceng bgt\nThe sync with the music is absolutely fire 🎶🔥\nBhai is montage ka flow ekdum makkhan hai 🧈✨\n究極技の重みが伝わってくる素晴らしい動画\n每一帧都是画报，博主简直是剪辑大神 🌟🎬\nSobrang petmalu nung timing ng skill lodi 🏅⚡\nBeneran kasta tertinggi fighter lane season ini 👑🛡️\nWatching the health bar vanish in slow-mo is satisfying 🤤💥\nBhai Sora ka edit dekha tha par ye bhi aag hai\n影のように素早い動き、でもスローでよく見える 🌑✨\n这种走位连招，对面坦克估计都怀疑人生了 🧱❌\nAng ganda ng transition, sobrang smooth lodi 🎥✨\nGila sih combo-nya bener-bener mematikan ☠️🌪️\nThat double dash was purely mechanical perfection ⚙️💎\nBhai is video ne toh system hila diya poora 💯🔥\nリズムに合わせて敵を倒すのが最高にクール 🥁🔥\n这爆发伤害，隔着屏幕都能感觉到疼 📉🩸\nNapakahusay nung pagkaka-execute nung burst combo 💥⚡\nAsli ngeri bgt damage-nya pas item-nya udah jadi 🛡️🔥\nThe definition of \\&quot;Hand Speed\\&quot; is right here\nBhai kya insane precision dikhayi tune 🎯✨\nこのエフェクト、何度見ても飽きないわ 🔁🔥\n那个转身后撤步简直是神来之笔 ✨🌪️\nLodi talaga, soul lost and victory found ⚰️🥇\nFix sih, hero ini emang gak ada đối thủ 🚫🥊\nLook at the muscles on this boxing champ 🥊💪\nBhai kya timing pe effects dale hain tune ✨🎬\nスローモーションの使い所が天才的すぎる 🧠🔥\n对面已经被这一套组合拳打懵了 😵🥊\nGrabe yung lodi speed ng dash mo, galing 💨👑\nBener-bener bikin musuh trauma laning exp 😭⚡\nThe stars were rewritten for this amazing outplay 🌟🏆\nBhai tune toh hero ko god level bana diya 🛐🔥\n彼の拳、戦場を支配している王のようだ 🥊🤴\n这一波细节走位我看呆了，真大神 🧠✨\nNapakabilis ng combo, parang kidlat sa laning 🌪️⚡\nMain MGCC bosen, mending liat slow-mo này 🎮✨\nThe perfect timing on the enhanced skill is key 🔑💥\nBhai is video ki quality toh 10/10 hai 💎🎬\n最後の一撃が完璧なタイミングで入ったね ⌛💥\n现在的排位要是选这种英雄就是秀 📈✨\nSobrang galing ng diskarte mo sa teamfight 🛡️✨\nBener-bener lincah, musuh cuma bisa pasrah 🏃‍♂️🚫\nIncredible edit, the sync is just perfect 🎶🔥\nBhai iska har hit ek dhamaka hai 💥🔥  \r\n\r\nCảm ơn bạn đã tin tưởng sử dụng dịch vụ của chúng tôi! Nếu bạn có bất kỳ câu hỏi nào, đừng ngần ngại liên hệ với chúng tôi.\r\n\r\nChúc bạn một ngày tuyệt vời! 😊', '8488846472:AAHk_SFKn1IfcWK0IpDwt5AE0o-U8RtHG10', '{\"ok\":false,\"error_code\":400,\"description\":\"Bad Request: message is too long\"}', '2026-03-13 16:49:48'),
