amage\nBhai, dushman team toh rone lagi hogi chat mein 😂😭\n彼の影に捕まったら最後、逃げ場はないよ\n在大招里跳舞的感觉真的太解压了 🤤✨\nSobrang solid nung build mo lodi, pashare naman 🛡️💎\nZaman Force duration feels like forever today ⏳🔥\nHarith is the real nightmare for slow fighters\nBhai iska cooldown zero hai kya? Crazy! 😱🌀\nカオス大乱闘ならもっとエグいことになりそう\n这种全屏位移，对面怎么预判你的位置 👁️❌\nAng galing nung timing ng bawat skill usage\nLincah parah, musuh cuma bisa bengong liatin 👁️👄👁️\nThe lifesteal is real when Zaman Force is up\nBhai, ye gameplay toh pro league level ka hai 🥇⚔️\n編集が綺麗で Harith がさらにかっこよく見える\n这个视频的特效被你剪辑得像电影大片 🎬🎞️\nHarith users be like: Press ult and spam dash\nGak ada obat, beneran beda level bro mantap 👍🔥\nZaman Force provides the perfect stage for kills\nBhai, kya insanely op precision dikhayi tune 🎯✨\n究極技が消える前に敵が全滅してるの草 🌱🚫\n每一帧都是画报，博主简直是剪辑大神 🎬🔥\nNapakahusay, outclassed yung kabilang midlaner 📈✨\nHarith remains a god in the right hands\nBhai, is video ki quality toh 10/10 hai 💎🎬\n彼女の舞、戦場を支配している女神のようだ 🌸✨\n这套连招配合这个BGM简直绝配了 🎵🔥\nLakas maka-vibe nung music choices mo bro 🎶✨\nMainnya rapi bgt, musuh sampe pusing nyarinya\nZero cooldown dashes are just too satisfying 🤤⚡\nBhai, tune toh hero ko god level bana diya 🛐🔥\nスピードも火力も、すべてにおいて上回ってる\n这一记重击直接把对面的尊严打没了 🔨❌\nNapakasolid ng logic mo sa game lodi sora fan 🧠⚡\nZaman Force activation is the end of the match\nBhai, is match ka hero toh Harith hi hai 🏆👑\n相手を絶望に突き落とすコンボ最高！ ✨🌪️\n面对这种压制，哪怕叫打野来也没用 📉🚫\nSobrang lupet ng edit mo lodi talaga boss! 🎬💎\nHarith is a literal beast in every teamfight 👹💥\nThis edit gives me chills, keep it up!\nBhai next level editing skills, keep it up 💯🎬\n魂まで削り取られるような立ち回りだね 👻✨\n对面的走位在这一波面前全是破绽 🎯✨\nGak bosen-bosen liat lifesteal-nya kenceng bgt\nHarith dash speed is just mind blowing bro 🧠⚡\nBhai iska har hit ek dhamaka hai 💥🔥\nこの曲を聴くと、なぜか勝利を確信するね 🎧✨\n这种操作手感，完全碾压了那个浮空怪\nRewrite the stars and get that win champion 🌟🏆\n編集のリズムとBGMが合ってて見てて楽しい ✨🎞️\n这个大招用的，解控杀人一气耗成 🗡️✨\nNakakabilib yung bawat move, grabe lodi 🙌🔥\nGak nyangka dapet savage se-clean này di rank 🏆✨\nThis slow motion breakdown shows how fast your fingers are\nBhai is level ki timing sirf pro players hi kar sakte hain\nこのボクサーの動きには一切の無駄がないですね\n对面的走位在这一波面前全是破绽\nNapakahusay nung fighter na to outclassed yung kalaban\nMainnya rapi banget musuh sampe pusing nyarinya\nThat punch logic is beyond my understanding\nBhai gold management seekh lo varna ye combo nahi banega\n完璧なポジショニング、プロの試合を見ているよう\n这种爆发力对面连大招都放不出来\nLodi talaga walang kupas yung skills sa fighter lane\nBeneran kasta tertinggi laning phase di season ini\nThe distance you keep while kiting is perfection\nBhai ye trick sikhna padega rank push ke liye\n隠密行動からの急襲これぞ最強の戦術\n这一场简直是单方面的屠杀太惨了\nNapakalakas ng presence mo sa map lodi\nGila damage-nya beneran gak masuk akal sih\nWatching him melt the enemy core in seconds is satisfying\nBhai is player ka aura hi alag hai MLBB mein\nステルス解除からのバーストダメージが凄まじい\n只要你会连招这局游戏你就赢了一半\nAng lupet nung double kill under tower kanina\nBener-bener gak dikasih nafas lawan di lane exp\nThe timing of the song is just flawless with the hits\nBhai kya insanely pro movement dikhaya tune boss\n彼の不屈の戦いぶりに本当に感動した\n这一战之后你就是国服第一操作手了\nNapaka-bilis ng kamay mo lodi sa pag-rotate\nBintang 3 di chess lewat gameplay này hơn hẳn\nWinning is easy when you take their soul first\nBhai is video ne mera din bana diya sachi mein\n彼の影に捕まったら最後逃げ場はない\n这一招回马枪真的绝了学到了学到了\nSobrang lodi talaga no debate needed here\nBener-bener penguasa Land of Dawn sejati\nStill the most dangerous fighter in the right hands\nBhai iska movement dushman ko pareshan karta hai\nこの編集スタイル海外のクリエイターみたい\n对面肯定在想为什么这么快就屏幕全黑了\nNapakasolid ng logic mo sa game lodi pro player\nFix sih hero ini emang king of late game\nLifesteal is the only thing keeping him alive there\nBhai marksman users ke liye ye tutorial hai\n彼の動きまるで残像を見ているようだ\n在顶级对决中这个大招的时机就是神\nAng lupet nung transition nung skin lodi\nMainnya quá khét đối thủ chỉ biết khóc thét\nThat outplay under the turret was purely mechanical\nBhai iska lifesteal toh tank ko bhi sharma