(2890, '861372', 96, 5, 760320, 'Instagram - Comments - Custom ~ Indian  🇮🇳 1k-5k/Days ~ INSTANT', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DVnvqWBk4xB/', 33, '2026-03-09 22:54:46', '2026-03-09 23:30:31', 'Completed', NULL, 781.466, 781.466, 679.536, 'That lifesteal is honestly making the enemy team tilt so hard 🩸💀\nBhai, 5 log milkar bhi Alice ko nahi hila paa rahe, insane durability! 🛡️🔥\n1v5 and still walking away with full HP? Only with the queen of blood 🧛‍♀️👑\n앨리스의 어둠의 마법은 진짜 무적 그 자체인 듯... 소름 돋는다 😱⚡\nGila sih, ini hero apa monster? Lifesteal-nya gak ada obat beneran 🩸💥\nNapakasolid ng sustain, kahit i-burst ng buong team walang talab lodi 🤙✨\nスキル1で飛び込んでULT全開、これぞ Alice の真骨頂だね ✨🌪️\n这种吸血量确实是不合法的前排存在，策划快看啊 📈🚫\nLook at those orbs fly, she\\\'s literally rewriting the rules of the match 🌌🔮\n5 gold units vs this dark mage? The outcome was already decided! 🥇💀\nSeeing her diving into five people and not dying is peak MLBB content\nIska sustain toh tank se bhi zyada tagda lag raha hai aaj\n敵チームが全力で殴ってるのに逆に回復してるの草\n这种暗黑魔法的压制力简直让人感到深深的绝望\n피흡량이 너무 말도 안 돼서 핵인 줄 알았어\nWalang kupas yung mechanical skill sa pag-ipon ng stacks kanina\nBeneran kasta tertinggi mage fighter kalau laning-nya kayak gini\nThe dark magic is just too strong in this current version of the game\nBhai is match mein toh logic hi fail ho gaya lifesteal dekh kar\nアリスが中心にいるだけで集団戦は勝ち確だよね\n即使是五个大招集火也杀不死这个血之女王\n5 대 1 상황에서도 피가 줄어들 생각을 안 하네 진짜\nSobrang galing ng timing ng skill 1 mo para makatakas at pumatay\nMain di rank pasti musuh pada auto ban hero ginian sih\nHow is she still standing after taking all that tower damage\nBhai iska build reveal kardo sachi mein bohot op lag raha hai\nこの究極技の回転率なら一生不死身でいられる気がする\n这种回血频率简直是把对面法师当成了移动泉水\n앨리스는 진짜 파면 팔수록 매력적인 영웅인 것 같음\nNapakasakit sa ulo nung healing effects lalo na pag late game na\nStrategi kasta tertinggi emang cuma nunggu item jadi terus war 5v5\nDarkness prevails every time she uses that blood wings combo\nBhai ye toh dushman ke liye sacha nightmare ban gayi hai match mein', NULL, '66368209', 55, 0, 'web', '0', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
(2891, '481529', 96, 5, 760320, 'Instagram - Comments - Custom ~ Indian  🇮🇳 1k-5k/Days ~ INSTANT', 'https://www.instagram.com/p/DVqvwXDid-4/', 20, '2026-03-09 22:58:19', '2026-03-09 23:31:28', 'Completed', NULL, 473.616, 473.616, 411.84, 'Watching them dash 100 times while I just press one button 😂⚡\nBhai wo Ling wall pe ud raha hai aur main yahan wait kar raha hoon 🕒🔪\n他の手速はすごいけど、私のワンパンはもっと確実だね ✨🗡️\n100 combos vs 1 click, the logic is simple and effective 🧠💥\nGila sih Hayabusa-nya lincah bgt, tapi tetep mati di udara ☁️💀\nNapaka-flashy ng Gusion pero isang ulti lang ang katapat nyan 🎯🔥\n别人在秀操作，而我在旁边默默按大招 🤫📉\n피지컬 싸움 할 때 나는 그냥 딸깍 한 번이면 끝남 🖱️👑\nImagine practicing for hours just to get countered by one tap 🤡🚫\nBeda kelas bgt, yang một pusing yang một santai aja bro 🤙🌊\nEveryone is practicing fast hands but I choose the easiest way\nWo Gusion ke blades ginte reh gaye aur main kill le gaya\n爆速コンボもいいけど、確実な一撃のほうが強い気がする\n华丽的走位在绝对的压制面前根本没有意义\n다른 사람들 손가락 바쁠 때 나는 그냥 여유롭게 구경함\nDaripada ribet mending sekali klik musuh langsung balik lobby\nGalawang lodi pero laging huli sa dulo ng talim ko\nThe enemy team is playing 4D chess while I am playing checkers\nMehnat unki hai par result mera hai sachi mein\nGusion players are always so busy but the result is the same', NULL, '66369435', 0, 0, 'web', '0', 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0),
